            <div xml:id="d297">

                <pb facs="0820" n="808" sameAs="frus:frus1946v04/pg808"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">CFM Files</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Note by the Secretariat</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">C.P.(Sec) N.S. 119</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<date calendar="gregorian" when="1946-09-06"
                                ><hi rendition="#small-caps">September</hi> 6,
                        1946</date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Covering letters addressed to the Secretary–General by the Austrian and Italian
                    Delegations, dated 6th September, 1946, and accompanying the text of an
                    Austro-Italian Agreement of 5th September, 1946, concerning the rights of the
                    German-speaking population of the South Tyrol [are herewith circulated,]
                    together with the text of the Agreement (transmitted in English by the Austrian
                    Delegation and in the three official languages by the Italian Delegation).</p>




